    "reviewTitle": "Disappointing.",
    "reviewDescription": "This was my second time purchasing these ear buds. My first pair worked great, but started to fizzle after about a year and a half. I used them often, so I didn't think much of it. I ordered another pair and got maybe two good months out of them. They stopped charging in the case despite cleaning the little connector pins in the case and on the individual buds several times. They wouldnt \"pause\" whatever i was playing when i put the buds in the case, either. I would keep them at my desk, and one morning I came in and the case had come apart (see photos) - even the lid had come off. I work in private Healthcare... no weird building conditions (like inconsistent temps, etc) and no one EVER touches my belongings in my office. Super disappointing because my initial experience was really good, but the product just doesn't seem to hold up.",
